A '''Geometric Oddity''' is a {{Rare}} [[Reforge Stone]] that applies the {{Reforge|Geometric}} [[Reforge]] to {{Item|Froggles}}, {{Item|Silver Froggles}}, {{Item|Golden Froggles}}, or {{Item|Diamond Froggles}}. It grants {{stat|fs}} and {{stat|Trophy Chance}}.

