==Usage==
===Reforging===
'''Geometric Oddity''' can be combined with {{Item|Froggles}}, {{Item|Silver Froggles}}, {{Item|Golden Froggles}}, or {{Item|Diamond Froggles}} using an [[Anvil]] or [[The Hex]] to apply the {{Reforge|Geometric}} reforge, to grant {{Stat|fs}} and {{stat|Trophy Chance}}, which scale with the Helmet's rarity. This has a skill requirement of {{skill|mining|15}}. A Helmet that is already reforged to {{reforge|Geometric}} will grant the stats, even if the player doesn't meet the requirement to apply it.

Additionally, it grants the '''{{blue|Geometric Bonus}}''', which gives the player a {{chance|5%|1|20}} chance to obtain a copy of a caught [[Trophy]], when fishing in a [[Wormhole]]
.
